"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Sydney</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">78 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Boston.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Boston</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">79 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Miami.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Miami</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">73 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Sanfran.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Sanfran</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">76 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Milan.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Milan</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">77 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Paris.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Paris</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">73 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Manhattan.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Manhattan</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">73 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Melbourne.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Melbourne</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">73 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Madrid.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">Madrid</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">73 ยูนิต</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section-box\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h2>Condominium</h2><div class=\"project-grid\"><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/change.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">The Change Relax Condo</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">524 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/thespace.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">The Space Condo</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">156-174 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/vcondo.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">V Condo</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">160 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/thechange.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">The Change Smart Value</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">511 ยูนิต</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section-box\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h2>Khao Yai</h2><div class=\"project-grid\"><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/H2O.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">H2O Condo เขาใหญ่</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">63 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/RK.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">อากาศ เขาใหญ่ คอนโด</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">98 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/SK.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">ชูเคร คอนโด เขาใหญ่</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">82 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/RL.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">อาเรีย ปุระ คอนโด เขาใหญ่</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">27 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/BKK.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">บ้านเขาใหญ่ คอนโด</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">141 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/TCM.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">เดอะโคลด์เม้าน์เท่น เรสซิเดนซ์</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">43 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/BLT.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">บ้านชลธาร เขาใหญ่ คอนโด</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">48 ยูนิต</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section-box\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h2>Housing Estate</h2><div class=\"project-grid\"><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Sirarom.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">สิรารมย์ 5,6</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">300 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/LN2.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">ลากูน่าวิลล์</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">58 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/ViTa.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">วิสต้า การ์เด้นท์</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">175-240 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/By.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">บียอนด์ หัวทะเล</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">138 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/ANSARA.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">อาณาสรา เฟส 1</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">172 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/theempire.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">The Empire</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">78 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/SiraromKY.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">สิรารมย์ เขาใหญ่</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">80 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/NaTrala.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">เนเทอร์ร่า พาร์ค</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">142 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/TheF.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">เดอะ เฟิร์ส 4 บายพาส-จอหอ</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">189 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Vn.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">เดอะ เวนิส ซานมาร์โค</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">188-192 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Sb.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">ศุภาลัย เบลล่า นครราชสีมา</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">221 ยูนิต</div></div></div><div class=\"project-card\"><div class=\"project-card-image\" style=\"background-image:url(/Neo.png)\"></div><div class=\"project-card-body\"><div class=\"project-card-name\">โกลเด้น นีโอ โคราช-เทอร์มินอล</div><div class=\"project-card-units\">491-495 ยูนิต</div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"section-box\" style=\"text-align:center\"><h2 style=\"display:inline-block\">ยังมีโครงการอื่นอีกมากมาย</h2><p style=\"color:var(--irm-text-muted);margin:0 auto\">และโครงการอื่นๆที่เราดูแลอยู่อีกมากมาย ทั่วประเทศด้วยทีมงานมืออาชีพที่พร้อมดูแลใส่ใจคุณทุกรายละเอียด</p></section></main><footer>IRM EXTRA © <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Premium Property Management Service</footer><style>\n        .project-grid {\n          display: grid;\n          grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n          gap: 1.2rem;\n          margin-top: 1rem;\n        }\n        .project-card {\n          background: #fff;\n          border-radius: 14px;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n          border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n          transition: transform 0.15s ease;\n        }\n        .project-card:hover {\n          transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n        .project-card-image {\n          width: 100%;\n          aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;\n          background-color: #e8e8e8;\n          background-size: cover;\n          background-position: center;\n        }\n        .project-card-body {\n          padding: 0.8rem 1rem;\n        }\n        .project-card-name {\n          font-weight: 600;\n          font-size: 0.95rem;\n          margin-bottom: 2px;\n        }\n        .project-card-units {\n          font-size: 0.82rem;\n          color: var(--irm-text-muted,